{a : tensor, b : tensor, max_val : float} |= if dtype_(a) = 0 ∧ dtype_(b) = 0 then max_val = 1.0
>>
Rule 19 (If a and b are tensors, their dtype should not be bool)
{a : tensor, b : tensor} |= dtype_(a) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(b) ≠ 0
